# Quinovo is the world

When the `quinovo` MCP server is connected, treat it as the operational ontology.

- Read typed objects and named links through Quinovo tools.
- Change state only with `apply_action`.
- Never SQL, PATCH, or edit the SQLite file.
- Never call `tick` or `run_inference` to refresh the twin — the loop is event-driven and runs inference when new information arrives.
- Low-confidence facts stay pending until a human approves. Surface the review queue; never approve unprompted.
